{"id":"n1-034","title":"Noun ではあるまいし (~dewa aru maishi)","jlptLevel":1,"shortExplanation":"Means 'it’s not as if...', 'it’s not that...', more formal than じゃあるまいし.","longExplanation":"「Noun + ではあるまいし」indicates that the noun is not the situation or reason being implied. It dismisses a possibility or justification, e.g. 'It’s not as if X, so don’t worry/do that/etc.' This is the more formal counterpart to じゃあるまいし.","formation":"Noun + ではあるまいし","examples":[{"jp":"彼女はプロの歌手ではあるまいし、完璧を求めるのは酷だ。","romaji":"Kanojo wa puro no kashu de wa aru mai shi, kanpeki o motomeru no wa koku da.","en":"She’s not a professional singer, so it’s rather harsh to demand perfection.","words":[{"surface":"彼女","vocabId":"1483150","reading":"かのじょ"},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"プロ","vocabId":null},{"surface":"の","vocabId":null},{"surface":"歌手","vocabId":"1193290","reading":"かしゅ"},{"surface":"で","vocabId":null},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"ある","vocabId":null},{"surface":"まい","vocabId":null},{"surface":"し","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"完璧","vocabId":"1590970","reading":"かんぺき"},{"surface":"を","vocabId":null},{"surface":"求める","vocabId":"1229350","reading":"もとめる"},{"surface":"の","vocabId":"1537250","reading":"の"},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"酷","vocabId":"1615840","reading":"こく"},{"surface":"だ","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[5,6,7,8,9]},{"jp":"彼は子供ではあるまいし、そんなにチョコレートばかり食べるのはどうかと思う。","romaji":"Kare wa kodomo de wa aru mai shi, sonnani chokoreeto bakari taberu no wa douka to omou.","en":"He’s not a child, so I’m not sure about him eating that much chocolate.","words":[{"surface":"彼","vocabId":"1483070","reading":"かれ"},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"子供","vocabId":"1307850","reading":"こども"},{"surface":"で","vocabId":null},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"ある","vocabId":null},{"surface":"まい","vocabId":null},{"surface":"し","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"そんなに","vocabId":null},{"surface":"チョコレート","vocabId":null},{"surface":"ばかり","vocabId":null},{"surface":"食べる","vocabId":"1358280","reading":"たべる"},{"surface":"の","vocabId":"1537250","reading":"の"},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"どう","vocabId":"1451730","reading":"どう"},{"surface":"か","vocabId":null},{"surface":"と","vocabId":null},{"surface":"思う","vocabId":"1589350","reading":"おもう"},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[3,4,5,6,7]},{"jp":"彼は医者ではあるまいし、あなたの健康状態を詮索する必要はない。","romaji":"Kare wa isha de wa aru mai shi, anata no kenkou joutai o sensaku suru hitsuyou wa nai.","en":"He’s not a doctor, so he has no need to pry into your health.","words":[{"surface":"彼","vocabId":"1483070","reading":"かれ"},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"医者","vocabId":"1159980","reading":"いしゃ"},{"surface":"で","vocabId":null},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"ある","vocabId":null},{"surface":"まい","vocabId":null},{"surface":"し","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"あなた","vocabId":null},{"surface":"の","vocabId":null},{"surface":"健康","vocabId":"1256170","reading":"けんこう"},{"surface":"状態","vocabId":"1356730","reading":"じょうたい"},{"surface":"を","vocabId":null},{"surface":"詮索","vocabId":"1392130","reading":"せんさく"},{"surface":"する","vocabId":"1595910","reading":"する"},{"surface":"必要","vocabId":"1487660","reading":"ひつよう"},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"ない","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[3,4,5,6,7]},{"jp":"この指輪は高価なものではあるまいし、落としても大したことはない。","romaji":"Kono yubiwa wa kouka na mono de wa aru mai shi, otoshite mo taishita koto wa nai.","en":"It’s not an expensive ring, so dropping it isn’t a big deal.","words":[{"surface":"この","vocabId":null},{"surface":"指輪","vocabId":"1310050","reading":"ゆびわ"},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"高価","vocabId":"1283300","reading":"こうか"},{"surface":"な","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"だ"},{"surface":"もの","vocabId":"1322990","reading":"もの"},{"surface":"で","vocabId":null,"